/target

# rustfmt keeps the pre-format copy of anything it rewrote.
**/*.rs.bk
# Debug symbols dropped beside a Windows build.
*.pdb

# Profiling and coverage output, written into whatever directory you ran the
# tool from.
*.profraw
*.profdata
/lcov.info
/tarpaulin-report.html
flamegraph.svg
perf.data
perf.data.old

# Editor state, per-developer and never shared.
/.idea/
.vscode/
.zed/
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# Whatever the OS leaves behind in a directory it has looked at.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent state that belongs to this checkout: where you left off, and the
# permissions you granted on this machine. The skill in `.claude/skills/`
# is shared and stays tracked.
/.claude/RESUME.md
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Secrets. Nothing here reads a dotenv today; the guard costs a line and its
# absence costs a leaked key.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
